    "Text and tables. Hunterbrook's article is dated Nov 10 in the table of pages, by its page data; the page itself prints Nov 6. The first tie line that cites it now says so, and that which stamp is right is not settled. Two census lines no longer say that Nvidia's investment in OpenAI is on no row. A remainder of the take-in's list gives both counts of pages. Seven recount lines on remarks differ between the two copies the reading compared, because the table of remarks is recomputed against the chips at every build; nothing was looked up again.",
