    'The same page, read for both companies. That page\'s subject is Anthropic\'s prospectus. A new line on Anthropic\'s own row gives what it says of Anthropic: "Anthropic expects that foreign spies will continue to try and infiltrate the company", and people who tried to be hired under false identities; and, from another page of that day, that the company "has committed to spending between $542 billion and $567 billion on future compute and infrastructure", with that page\'s note that other tallies run higher.',
